# AI agent modes and the harness > The envelope of an update run > After the run — green
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L170
# 32b3cda0b610d6636b3bbd17b9ddce57b43ec80b

test::a Run the tests ::e
  --> after::a Commit the result ::e
  --> free::a Release the write lock ::e

# This diagram tells one attempt too — the one that passes.
test, after, free --::P--> whole::a Attempt an update ::e

hn::a agent harness ::t --> test, after, free
tests::a repo tests ::t --> test
mainwt::a main worktree ::t --> test, after
c1::a update commit ::t --> after
wl::a repo write lock ::t --> free

test --> tests per run ::c
after --> commit after ::c, own commit per mode ::c

hn --> harness ::c
tests --> test suite ::c
mainwt --> ipm knowledge base ::c
c1 --> commit ::c
wl --> write lock ::c
